@host = http://localhost:5124

### Tokens desde Rest/auth.http
@tutor47Token = <PEGAR_TOKEN_TUTOR_47>
@tutor48Token = <PEGAR_TOKEN_TUTOR_48>
@student17Token = <PEGAR_TOKEN_STUDENT_17>

### ========================================
### SMOKE TEST + REGLAS DE AISLAMIENTO
### ========================================

### [OK] Niveles con JWT valido
GET {{host}}/levels
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [OK] Tutor self access
GET {{host}}/tutors/47
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [FORBIDDEN esperado] Tutor 47 no accede a tutor 48
GET {{host}}/tutors/48
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [OK] Tutor 47 lista sus students
GET {{host}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [FORBIDDEN esperado] Tutor 47 no accede student 19 (tutor 48)
GET {{host}}/students/19
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [OK] Student 17 ve su propio registro
GET {{host}}/students/17
Authorization: Bearer {{student17Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [FORBIDDEN esperado] Student 17 no ve student 18
GET {{host}}/students/18
Authorization: Bearer {{student17Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [OK] Sessions (hoy requieren JWT pero sin filtro por tutor)
GET {{host}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [OK] Level results (hoy requieren JWT pero sin filtro por tutor)
GET {{host}}/level-results
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json
